        Filter: EBV(BOOLEAN_AS_TERM(EBV(BOOLEAN_AS_TERM(NOT EXISTS (<subquery>))) AND EBV(BOOLEAN_AS_TERM(NOT EXISTS (<subquery>)))))
          Subquery:
            Filter: outer_ref(s1) = __inner__s1
